Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.24,0:02:21.20,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Destiny is mine
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.20,0:02:23.33,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}osore shitte mo
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.33,0:02:27.75,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}subete no mirai togirenu you ni
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.75,0:02:34.01,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Shoot a thread of light
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.97,0:02:43.94,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}itami o norikoeru tabi
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.94,0:02:53.65,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}kokoro wa eiri ni togisumasareru (Never give up)
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.65,0:03:01.99,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}kurikaesareru shukumei no saihate de
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.99,0:03:05.79,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}hikari chiru umi ni chikau
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.46,0:03:08.46,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Getting through
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.46,0:03:10.67,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}ikiru imi o
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.67,0:03:16.18,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}sekai ni nokosu kara
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.97,0:03:18.97,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Heaven’s falling down
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.97,0:03:21.22,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}sora otoshite mo
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.22,0:03:25.89,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}nozomi o kudakou kyouki no kami no
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.89,0:03:27.98,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Destiny is mine
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.98,0:03:30.02,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}osore shitte mo
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.02,0:03:34.53,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}subete no mirai togirenu you ni
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.53,0:03:38.99,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}tomosu honoo ga
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.99,0:03:45.16,OP3 Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}inochi no kirameki (Destiny will begin tonight)
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.24,0:02:21.20,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le destin est mien
Dialogue: 10,0:02:21.20,0:02:23.33,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si la peur me retient
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.33,0:02:27.75,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je ne laisserai pas nos futurs être brisés
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.75,0:02:34.01,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je tirerai un fil de lumière
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.97,0:02:43.94,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Chaque fois que je surmonte la douleur
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.94,0:02:53.65,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Mon cœur devient plus affûté (N’abandonne jamais)
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.65,0:03:01.99,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Au bout de ce destin sans fin
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.99,0:03:05.79,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je fais le serment devant cette océan lumineux
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.46,0:03:08.46,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Que je tiendrai bon
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.46,0:03:10.67,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si je tombe ici
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.67,0:03:16.18,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je lèguerai le sens de la vie
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.97,0:03:18.97,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le ciel s’effondre
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.97,0:03:21.22,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si le firmament me tombe dessus
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.22,0:03:25.89,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je briserai les desseins d’un dieu fou
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.89,0:03:27.98,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Le destin est mien
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.98,0:03:30.02,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Même si la peur me retient
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.02,0:03:34.53,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Je ne laisserai pas nos futurs être brisés
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.53,0:03:38.99,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}J’allume une flamme
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.99,0:03:45.16,OP3 English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}L’étincelle de la vie (Le destin commencera ce soir)
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.98,0:22:20.07,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Même si tu penses que je fais face
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.07,0:22:25.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Ma tête est remplie d'espoir
Dialogue: 10,0:22:25.28,0:22:34.17,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}D'un quelconque endroit autre qu'ici
Dialogue: 10,0:22:35.25,0:22:40.26,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Même si tu penses que je souris
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.26,0:22:45.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Intérieurement et pendant tout ce temps
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.59,0:22:53.85,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je m'interroge sur mon destin
Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.48,0:23:00.44,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je pense à
Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.44,0:23:05.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Toutes les choses
Dialogue: 10,0:23:05.36,0:23:10.33,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Que j'aimerais faire
Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.33,0:23:14.62,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Dans ma vie
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.62,0:23:19.38,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je suis un rêveur
Dialogue: 10,0:23:19.38,0:23:24.63,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Un lointain songeur
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.63,0:23:30.14,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Rêvant d'espoir
Dialogue: 10,0:23:30.14,0:23:34.23,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Dès à présent
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.98,0:22:20.07,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.07,0:22:25.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 10,0:22:25.28,0:22:34.17,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Of some place other than here
Dialogue: 10,0:22:35.25,0:22:40.26,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 10,0:22:40.26,0:22:45.59,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.59,0:22:53.85,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm wondering about my destiny
Dialogue: 10,0:22:54.48,0:23:00.44,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm thinking about
Dialogue: 10,0:23:00.44,0:23:05.36,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}All the things
Dialogue: 10,0:23:05.36,0:23:10.33,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'd like to do
Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.33,0:23:14.62,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}In my life
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.62,0:23:19.38,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm a dreamer
Dialogue: 10,0:23:19.38,0:23:24.63,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}A distant dreamer
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.63,0:23:30.14,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Dreaming far away
Dialogue: 10,0:23:30.14,0:23:34.23,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}From today

